              "22. We therefore ask your paternal affection that, through letters sent by you to us and to the most holy bishop of this noble city and patriarch, your brother, since he himself also wrote through the same men to your holiness, hastening in all things to follow the apostolic See of your blessedness, you make clear to us that your holiness receives all who rightly confess the things stated above, and condemns the perfidy of those who have dared, in a Judaizing manner, to deny the right faith.",

