              "29. Only those oppose your professions of whom divine Scripture speaks, saying: 'they placed their hope in falsehood and hoped to be covered by falsehood'; and again those who, according to the prophet, say to the Lord: 'depart from us, we do not wish to know your ways', on account of whom Solomon says: 'they have erred from the paths of their own cultivation, and they gather fruitless things with their hands'.",

              "30. This, therefore, is your true faith, this is the certain religion; this is what, as we have said, all the fathers of blessed memory and the prelates of the Roman Church, whom we follow in all things, and the apostolic See, have preached until now and have guarded unshaken: whoever has appeared as a contradictor of this confession and this faith has judged himself alien to holy communion and alien to the catholic Church.",

              "31. For in the city of Rome we found Cyrus with his followers, who was from the monastery of the Akoimetoi; we strove, by apostolic exhortations, to call them back to the right faith and, like sheep that had gone astray and were lost, to the Lord’s fold, so that they might recognize, according to the prophet, that stammering tongues speak things of peace.",

              "32. But to those who did not believe, through us the first of the apostles speaks the words of the prophet Isaiah: 'go to the light of your fire and to the flame which you have kindled'. But their heart was hardened, as it is written, so that they did not understand, and the sheep that were not mine refused to hear the voice of the shepherd.",

              "33. Regarding them, observing those things which were established by their own pontiff, we by no means received them into our communion, and we ordered them to be alien to the whole catholic Church, unless, having condemned their error, they should sign as soon as possible, by a regular profession, that they follow our doctrine.",

